<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat January subproduct shipment figures (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    593,415  (834,729)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    131,089  (127,355)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	   nil    (7,670)</p>
<p> Linseed expls    13,627   (12,349)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    5,516    (6,889)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl    3,840   (15,807)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     151,985  (117,294)</p>
<p>    Sunoil	  50,413    (60,249)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in January were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: Holland 111,396; France 83,469; Belgium; 61,082; Italy 51,942.</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 56,545; Belgium 17,306; France 14,000</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0666))</p>
